# Copied to homelab/tailscale.env by bootstrap.sh. Leave TS_AUTHKEY unset to sign the node in
# interactively: `docker compose logs tailscale` prints a login URL on first start. Only for an
# unattended first start, paste a one-off, non-ephemeral key from
# https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys. Either way the identity then lives in
# ./tailscale-state and the key is no longer needed.
# TS_AUTHKEY=tskey-auth-...
